<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-TRANSVAAL BEAT GRIQUALAND WEST BY 93 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-TRANSVAAL BEAT GRIQUALAND WEST BY 93 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transvaal beat Griqualand</p>
<p>West by 93 runs in their four-day Supersport Series cricket</p>
<p>match at Kimberley which ended on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Griqualand West 327 and 214 (R.Koster 74; C.Eksteen</p>
<p>4-72), Transvaal 440-6 dec and 194-4 dec (A.Bacher 112 not out).</p>
</text>
